{
  "id": "E120",
  "title": "Eat Enough to Lose Weight",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2017-05-28",
  "synopsis": "With all the temptations in life it is hard to find time to loose weight.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/430/081c63ff30040506e8188882354f107b994bc128.mp3?1495475457",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "吃饱再减肥\n\n王力：林红，周六去我家吃饭吧，保罗也来。\n林红：不行，我要减肥。\n王力：你为什么要减肥？\n林红：夏天到了，瘦一点穿裙子好看。\n王力：你现在一点都不胖。\n林红：我比去年夏天胖了4斤！\n王力：好吧，我买了好多小龙虾和啤酒呢。\n林红：等等，你买了小龙虾？\n王力：对啊，很新鲜的。\n林红：我去！吃饱才有力气减肥！",
    "traditional": "吃飽再減肥\n\n王力：林紅，週六去我家吃飯吧，保羅也來。\n林紅：不行，我要減肥。\n王力：你為什麼要減肥？\n林紅：夏天到了，瘦一點穿裙子好看。\n王力：你現在一點都不胖。\n林紅：我比去年夏天胖了4斤！\n王力：好吧，我買了好多小龍蝦和啤酒呢。\n林紅：等等，你買了小龍蝦？\n王力：對啊，很新鮮的。\n林紅：我去！吃飽才有力氣減肥！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Eat enough to lose weight"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "王力：林红，周六去我家吃饭吧，保罗也来。",
      "traditional": "王力：林紅，週六去我家吃飯吧，保羅也來。",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì lín hóng zhōu liù qù wǒ jiā chī fàn ba bǎo luó yě lái",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Lin Hong, come and have dinner at my place on Saturday. Paul will come as well."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "林红：不行，我要减肥。",
      "traditional": "林紅：不行，我要減肥。",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng bù xíng wǒ yào jiǎn féi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: No, I need to lose weight."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "王力：你为什么要减肥？",
      "traditional": "王力：你為什麼要減肥？",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì nǐ wèi shén me yào jiǎn féi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Why do you need to lose weight?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "林红：夏天到了，瘦一点穿裙子好看。",
      "traditional": "林紅：夏天到了，瘦一點穿裙子好看。",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng xià tiān dào le shòu yì diǎn chuān qún zi hǎo kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: Summer is coming. Being slimmer will make me look better in a dress."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "王力：你现在一点都不胖。",
      "traditional": "王力：你現在一點都不胖。",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì nǐ xiàn zài yì diǎn dōu bú pàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: You are not fat at all now."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "林红：我比去年夏天胖了4斤！",
      "traditional": "林紅：我比去年夏天胖了4斤！",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng wǒ bǐ qù nián xià tiān pàng le sì jīn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: I’m 2 kg heavier than last summer!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "王力：好吧，我买了好多小龙虾和啤酒呢。",
      "traditional": "王力：好吧，我買了好多小龍蝦和啤酒呢。",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì hǎo ba wǒ mǎi le hǎo duō xiǎo lóng xiā hé pí jiǔ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Fine. I bought a lot of crawfish and beer."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "林红：等等，你买了小龙虾？",
      "traditional": "林紅：等等，你買了小龍蝦？",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng děng děng nǐ mǎi le xiǎo lóng xiā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: Wait, did you buy crawfish?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "王力：对啊，很新鲜的。",
      "traditional": "王力：對啊，很新鮮的。",
      "pinyin": "wáng lì duì a hěn xīn xiān de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wang Li: Yeah, really fresh ones."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "林红：我去！吃饱才有力气减肥！",
      "traditional": "林紅：我去！吃飽才有力氣減肥！",
      "pinyin": "lín hóng wǒ qù chī bǎo cái yǒu lì qi jiǎn féi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lin Hong: I’ll come! Only when you eat enough will you have strength to lose weight!"
    }
  ],
